<mxCell id="s165" value="&lt;b&gt;CityFM&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1E293B" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="796" width="175" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s166" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#2563EB;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="798" width="193.5" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s167" value="&lt;b&gt;43%&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1E293B" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1491.5" y="796" width="80" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s168" value="&lt;b&gt;Not a held-out test.&lt;/b&gt; The quiz draws from the same buildings training used, and training saw about 320,000 footprints, more than Leeds has (262,714). Most quiz buildings were seen in training, so 43% is close to a training score." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#64748B" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="834" width="470" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s169" value="&lt;b&gt;What it shows.&lt;/b&gt; After stage 2, the footprint embedding distinguishes building types by shape and size. It gives the right type 57% of the time with either method, against 19-27% from floor area or the untrained image network. The type text most similar to a footprint is its own type 47% of the time, with no training for this test. The remaining errors are mostly between types that look alike or mean much the same: house types, &lt;i&gt;building: school&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;amenity: school&lt;/i&gt;, farms and farm buildings." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="960" width="1570" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s170" value="&lt;b&gt;Chance&lt;/b&gt;: 1 in 18 types (1 in 64 in the quiz).   &lt;b&gt;Floor area alone&lt;/b&gt;: no picture.   &lt;b&gt;Untrained image network&lt;/b&gt;: ResNet-18 with its ImageNet weights, before stage 2 (outline only; area added in the classifier).   5,269 buildings; same scale in all charts." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#64748B" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1048" width="1570" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
